WEBVTT

01:33.350 --> 01:35.621
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.681 --> 01:37.981
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.050 --> 01:40.951
(Episode 22)

01:41.190 --> 01:42.791
Drive.

01:50.201 --> 01:50.901
Everyone,

01:50.960 --> 01:52.201
come back as soon as you can.

02:05.481 --> 02:07.410
Sir, let me help you up, come on.

02:07.981 --> 02:09.220
Be careful.

02:09.421 --> 02:10.121
Be careful.

02:10.181 --> 02:11.520
Take them to an open area.

02:11.591 --> 02:12.250
Okay.

02:12.321 --> 02:13.690
Let's go to the Transfusion Area...

02:13.750 --> 02:14.821
in case there are any patients who need assistance.

02:14.891 --> 02:15.561
Let's go.

02:16.490 --> 02:18.231
- Help! - Doctor!

02:18.291 --> 02:21.400
- Hurry, Doctor! - Help!

02:21.460 --> 02:22.161
Doctor.

02:22.231 --> 02:23.261
Thank you, Doctor.

02:23.330 --> 02:24.530
There was an earthquake, right?

02:24.601 --> 02:26.631
Yes. I'll take you to a safe place now.

02:26.870 --> 02:28.101
- It's okay. - It's so scary.

02:29.441 --> 02:30.240
Be careful, everyone.

02:30.300 --> 02:31.511
Evacuate the people first.

02:39.411 --> 02:42.421
(Benevolence and Integrity)

02:47.221 --> 02:47.990
Excuse me.

02:48.891 --> 02:49.661
Give me a hand.

02:50.490 --> 02:51.761
Everything is fine. Don't worry.

02:56.830 --> 02:57.930
There's no signal.

03:01.270 --> 03:02.171
Is there no signal?

03:06.971 --> 03:07.810
I got a signal.

03:07.870 --> 03:08.541
I got it.

03:09.381 --> 03:10.310
I got a signal.

03:16.951 --> 03:18.291
(Urgent! 6.5 magnitude earthquake in Wangxiang, Yancheng)

03:18.351 --> 03:19.391
The magnitude is 6.5.

03:19.851 --> 03:20.921
It's already like this here.

03:20.990 --> 03:22.391
Isn't it worse at the epicenter?

03:22.560 --> 03:23.821
The epicenter is in Wangxiang.

03:24.060 --> 03:25.261
The magnitude is 6.5.

03:25.430 --> 03:26.731
Gosh, it's such a big earthquake.

03:27.490 --> 03:28.460
That doctor from Neurosurgery...

03:28.530 --> 03:29.800
seems to be from Wangxiang too.

03:29.860 --> 03:30.631
Dr. Tian.

03:30.701 --> 03:31.471
- Right. - By the way,

03:31.930 --> 03:33.930
Dr. Wei from Orthopedics is from there too.

03:42.080 --> 03:43.011
One, two, one.

03:43.381 --> 03:45.610
One, one, two, one.

03:46.011 --> 03:48.180
One, one, two, one.

03:48.451 --> 03:49.221
Turn right.

03:49.280 --> 03:53.520
(Party Loyalty, Strict Discipline, Defy Danger and Death)

03:53.590 --> 03:54.351
Halt.

03:55.590 --> 03:56.620
Face left.

03:57.360 --> 03:58.360
Align to your right.

04:00.860 --> 04:01.661
Eyes front.

04:05.930 --> 04:06.830
Chief.

04:07.101 --> 04:08.971
Shilitai Fire and Rescue Station Combat Squad is assembled.

04:09.041 --> 04:09.870
Please give your command.

04:09.941 --> 04:10.740
All are present and accounted for.

04:11.240 --> 04:12.511
Face right.

04:13.571 --> 04:14.370
Board.

04:29.761 --> 04:30.621
Comrades. Brothers.

04:30.691 --> 04:32.191
Each minute that passes by...

04:32.261 --> 04:33.391
in the critical 72 hours...

04:33.460 --> 04:34.861
is equivalent to a loss of lives.

04:35.061 --> 04:36.261
A disaster is a command.

04:36.501 --> 04:38.900
We save people from difficulties and danger.

04:38.970 --> 04:40.730
We must complete this mission.

04:41.270 --> 04:41.970
Squad One, copy.

04:42.040 --> 04:42.701
Squad Two, copy.

04:42.770 --> 04:43.571
Squad Three, copy.

04:43.641 --> 04:44.301
Comrades.

04:45.040 --> 04:46.611
The earthquake's occurrence...

04:47.371 --> 04:49.181
touched the hearts of all circles in society.

04:49.241 --> 04:50.311
(Wangxiang Earthquake Emergency Mobilization Meeting)

04:50.381 --> 04:52.381
Under the guidance of municipal committee leaders,

04:53.451 --> 04:54.251
all units...

04:54.580 --> 04:55.751
have already taken action.

04:56.520 --> 04:57.520
Based on what I know,

04:58.020 --> 04:59.321
the Fire and Rescue Department...

04:59.391 --> 05:00.650
immediately sent...

05:00.790 --> 05:02.020
an elite team...

05:02.160 --> 05:03.090
to Wangxiang.

05:03.590 --> 05:04.691
Natural disasters are merciless.

05:05.330 --> 05:06.391
Humans are compassionate.

05:07.230 --> 05:08.030
Our hospital...

05:08.501 --> 05:10.230
will also send an elite team...

05:10.301 --> 05:11.330
to the frontline.

05:12.131 --> 05:13.230
Members of the party...

05:13.670 --> 05:14.830
must charge ahead.

05:15.701 --> 05:16.371
I'm a member of the party.

05:16.871 --> 05:17.571
I'll sign up.

05:18.511 --> 05:19.210
I'll sign up too.

05:19.941 --> 05:20.741
Me too.

05:21.371 --> 05:22.111
I'm in too.

05:22.280 --> 05:23.040
Thoracic Surgery. I'm signing up.

05:23.111 --> 05:24.241
I'm from Pediatrics. I'm in.

05:24.311 --> 05:25.410
I'm from General Surgery. I'm in.

05:25.480 --> 05:26.181
We're in.

05:26.251 --> 05:27.051
I'll sign up too.

05:27.111 --> 05:27.910
Each department...

05:27.980 --> 05:29.121
should go back and do a headcount...

05:29.181 --> 05:30.121
and prepare supplies.

05:30.451 --> 05:31.381
After an hour,

05:31.451 --> 05:32.121
we'll set off.

05:34.090 --> 05:35.220
Pack as much as you can.

05:35.290 --> 05:36.420
Transfusion needles, transfusion pads,

05:36.590 --> 05:37.520
swabs, and alcohol.

05:37.590 --> 05:38.891
Pack a lot of these.

05:40.391 --> 05:41.431
Dong Dong, what's the progress here?

05:41.491 --> 05:42.160
I'm done.

05:42.230 --> 05:43.160
I have hazmat suits...

05:43.230 --> 05:44.431
and disposable scrubs.

05:45.030 --> 05:46.530
Should we prepare a change of clothes?

05:46.701 --> 05:47.871
How long are we staying?

05:48.641 --> 05:49.340
Xiao Xi.

05:49.501 --> 05:50.540
How many clothes did you bring?

05:51.141 --> 05:52.040
I saw that people from the other teams...

05:52.111 --> 05:52.840
brought two sets of clothes,

05:52.910 --> 05:54.371
so I just prepared a few.

05:55.040 --> 05:58.011
Dr. Xu, what if we've got no change of clothes?

05:58.580 --> 05:59.681
We'll see.

06:00.980 --> 06:02.650
Should we prepare some food and drinks?

06:02.720 --> 06:03.951
It'll take 4 to 5 hours to get there.

06:04.020 --> 06:06.121
But we don't even know the situation there.

06:07.051 --> 06:08.460
Have you told your families?

06:08.660 --> 06:09.420
Not yet.

06:09.491 --> 06:10.420
There's no time.

06:12.691 --> 06:14.530
We still have 10 minutes before departure.

06:14.691 --> 06:16.160
Call your families.

06:16.301 --> 06:17.201
- Okay. - Okay.

06:31.340 --> 06:32.350
Hi, Dad.

06:32.410 --> 06:33.150
Hello, Dad.

06:33.951 --> 06:34.710
Qin Qin.

06:34.850 --> 06:36.451
I joined the hospital's medical team...

06:36.520 --> 06:37.381
that's going to visit Wangxiang.

06:37.681 --> 06:38.650
How long will you be gone?

06:39.020 --> 06:40.191
I don't know yet.

06:40.251 --> 06:41.790
It might take a while.

06:41.920 --> 06:42.920
Okay.

06:43.061 --> 06:44.220
Be careful.

06:44.821 --> 06:45.960
Before you go to bed every night,

06:46.030 --> 06:47.491
let us know that you're safe.

06:48.090 --> 06:49.001
I got it.

06:49.561 --> 06:51.201
Regarding Mom...

06:51.261 --> 06:52.201
I'll tell her.

06:52.270 --> 06:53.071
Don't worry.

06:53.730 --> 06:55.141
You must be careful.

06:56.701 --> 06:57.540
That's all for now.

06:57.600 --> 06:58.410
Bye, Dad.

07:03.641 --> 07:05.051
I joined the hospital's medical team...

07:05.280 --> 07:06.280
that's going to Wangxiang for a few days.

07:06.381 --> 07:07.910
I can't talk on the phone there.

07:08.080 --> 07:09.321
Leave me a message if you need anything.

07:20.730 --> 07:23.100
Hello, the subscriber you're calling...

07:29.470 --> 07:31.040
(The First People's Hospital of Yancheng)

08:02.441 --> 08:03.371
Attention, all units.

08:03.441 --> 08:05.371
There's a landslide ahead.

08:05.710 --> 08:06.611
Prepare to get off.

08:14.650 --> 08:15.451
There's a landslide.

08:15.850 --> 08:16.580
Be careful.

08:16.650 --> 08:17.321
Okay.

08:17.451 --> 08:18.121
This way.

08:20.590 --> 08:21.251
Let's go through here.

08:21.321 --> 08:22.160
Be careful.

08:27.061 --> 08:27.761
Song Yan.

08:28.061 --> 08:29.261
What's the situation up ahead?

08:31.730 --> 08:32.770
The landslide area is huge.

08:33.071 --> 08:34.131
We won't be able to clear it quickly.

08:34.371 --> 08:35.100
The vehicle can't go through.

08:35.501 --> 08:36.170
But we have to go through it.

08:36.600 --> 08:37.441
Let's get going.

08:37.641 --> 08:38.301
Okay.

08:38.710 --> 08:40.170
I'll report this to the headquarters.

08:40.341 --> 08:41.011
Okay.

08:41.881 --> 08:42.641
- Yang Chi. - Yes.

08:42.780 --> 08:43.981
Let the driver stay and watch the vehicle.

08:44.241 --> 08:45.081
The rest of you,

08:45.211 --> 08:46.310
bring all the equipment...

08:46.381 --> 08:47.150
you can carry.

08:47.211 --> 08:48.251
We'll leave in five minutes.

08:48.450 --> 08:49.121
Okay.

08:49.251 --> 08:50.420
- Yes. - Everyone, get off...

08:50.481 --> 08:51.180
and pack your equipment.

08:51.251 --> 08:52.190
We'll leave in five minutes.

08:54.091 --> 08:54.920
Watch your step.

08:59.430 --> 09:00.261
Be careful.

09:00.891 --> 09:01.660
Be careful.

09:05.601 --> 09:06.570
Watch your step.

09:22.920 --> 09:23.621
Class Monitor.

09:23.680 --> 09:25.121
Is magnitude 6.5 very serious?

09:25.190 --> 09:26.320
Some houses must have collapsed.

09:26.391 --> 09:27.391
I hope everyone got out.

09:27.491 --> 09:29.160
Every minute of the critical 72 hours of rescue...

09:29.660 --> 09:30.920
is very precious.

09:31.420 --> 09:32.231
Guys.

09:32.530 --> 09:33.560
Pick up the pace.

09:33.690 --> 09:34.660
- Yes! - Okay!

09:37.060 --> 09:37.731
Can you manage?

09:37.800 --> 09:38.471
Yes.

09:39.731 --> 09:40.400
Give it to me.

09:40.670 --> 09:41.331
I'll do it.

09:41.700 --> 09:42.570
Preserve your energy...

09:43.141 --> 09:43.800
to save people.

09:44.400 --> 09:45.570
Come on, guys!

09:46.040 --> 09:46.841
We can do this!

10:35.420 --> 10:36.560
- Messenger. - Present.

10:41.631 --> 10:46.430
(Yancheng Fire)

10:47.871 --> 10:48.940
We're already in Wangxiang.

10:49.641 --> 10:50.570
The houses in town...

10:50.900 --> 10:51.971
have collapsed very badly.

10:52.310 --> 10:53.770
We don't know the extent of the casualties.

10:54.410 --> 10:55.241
The visual assessment...

10:56.940 --> 10:57.741
doesn't look good.

10:59.611 --> 11:00.650
Start the rescue immediately.

11:00.810 --> 11:01.481
Yes.

11:01.711 --> 11:02.381
Understood.

11:02.450 --> 11:03.121
Sirs.

11:05.320 --> 11:06.020
Sirs.

11:06.621 --> 11:07.420
You're here.

11:07.690 --> 11:08.721
This is great.

11:10.121 --> 11:11.290
I'm the secretary here.

11:11.930 --> 11:12.891
The town hall...

11:12.961 --> 11:13.861
also collapsed.

11:14.091 --> 11:15.400
We set up a temporary shelter...

11:15.461 --> 11:16.700
at the school across from it.

11:17.131 --> 11:18.871
I'll take you there to get some rest.

11:18.971 --> 11:19.670
There's no need.

11:19.731 --> 11:20.570
Saving lives is more important.

11:21.070 --> 11:22.241
Which areas do you have trapped people now?

11:22.741 --> 11:23.471
Follow me.

11:23.540 --> 11:24.200
Let's go!

11:45.020 --> 11:47.861
(Ambulance)

11:49.761 --> 11:51.101
This is a video...

11:51.160 --> 11:52.530
from the Fire and Rescue Team.

11:52.601 --> 11:54.270
From the video, we can see...

11:54.371 --> 11:56.040
that the houses in town have collapsed very badly.

11:56.101 --> 11:57.501
The firefighters who arrived first...

11:57.570 --> 11:59.410
had already begun their rescue operation on the spot.

11:59.711 --> 12:01.410
We found out from the command center...

12:01.471 --> 12:02.581
that a large number of rescue teams...

12:02.641 --> 12:04.241
are on their way to Wangxiang.

12:12.851 --> 12:13.621
Hello, Yan Chen.

12:13.690 --> 12:14.491
Hello, Qin Qin.

12:14.650 --> 12:16.320
Why aren't you picking up the phone?

12:17.060 --> 12:18.020
The signal is very bad.

12:18.961 --> 12:19.961
Where are you?

12:21.961 --> 12:22.631
Qin Qin.

12:23.731 --> 12:24.800
I'm still on the road.

12:26.300 --> 12:27.371
Be careful.

12:27.800 --> 12:28.530
If you need anything,

12:28.601 --> 12:29.601
call me anytime.

12:30.141 --> 12:30.871
Got it.

12:30.940 --> 12:31.841
Don't worry.

12:32.540 --> 12:33.440
Bye.

12:56.601 --> 12:57.400
Let's split up.

12:57.861 --> 12:59.101
Yes. This way.

13:09.810 --> 13:10.611
Life detector.

13:10.741 --> 13:11.410
Okay.

13:11.481 --> 13:12.511
- Follow me. - Come on.

13:12.581 --> 13:13.251
- Let's go. - Keep up.

13:13.310 --> 13:13.981
Yes.

13:20.721 --> 13:21.420
Everything is in place.

13:23.920 --> 13:24.660
- Jiang Yi. - Done.

13:30.261 --> 13:31.501
Doctor!

13:39.810 --> 13:41.611
Chief, there's someone trapped down here.

13:41.940 --> 13:42.741
The rest, keep searching.

13:42.810 --> 13:43.481
Okay.

13:45.410 --> 13:46.450
Come on, let's do it together.

13:46.780 --> 13:49.420
- One, two, three. - One, two, three.

13:49.820 --> 13:52.121
- One, two, three. - One, two, three.

13:52.251 --> 13:54.721
- One, two, three. - One, two, three.

14:00.361 --> 14:01.231
Be careful.

14:02.060 --> 14:03.261
- Excuse me. - Move.

14:03.331 --> 14:04.001
Excuse me.

14:07.770 --> 14:08.841
There's a sign of life!

14:10.570 --> 14:11.241
Everyone, go!

14:11.371 --> 14:12.270
- Yes. - Yes.

14:14.910 --> 14:15.581
Save him!

14:15.641 --> 14:16.310
Hurry.

14:16.381 --> 14:17.241
Yes.

14:23.650 --> 14:24.420
Come on.

14:25.820 --> 14:27.221
Is anyone there?

14:27.391 --> 14:28.121
Hello?

14:28.621 --> 14:29.560
Is anyone there?

14:29.861 --> 14:31.091
Is anyone down there?

14:31.290 --> 14:32.361
Help me.

14:33.060 --> 14:33.761
Over here.

14:34.761 --> 14:35.660
Don't worry.

14:35.800 --> 14:37.200
We'll get you out of there.

14:37.731 --> 14:38.461
Right now,

14:38.530 --> 14:39.570
you have to conserve your energy.

14:39.871 --> 14:40.700
Don't fall asleep.

14:40.770 --> 14:41.530
Understand?

14:41.601 --> 14:42.270
Chief.

14:42.540 --> 14:43.570
I'll get the hydraulic ram.

14:43.741 --> 14:44.471
Go.

14:49.211 --> 14:50.940
Why don't we just use a hammer to break it open?

14:51.780 --> 14:52.550
We can't.

14:52.851 --> 14:53.810
There's someone down there.

14:53.881 --> 14:54.851
It's dangerous if we break it.

14:55.111 --> 14:56.150
This wall is a bit troublesome.

14:56.221 --> 14:56.881
If things go wrong,

14:56.981 --> 14:58.251
there's a risk of it collapsing again.

14:59.290 --> 15:00.520
Clear the rocks on top first,

15:00.591 --> 15:01.391
then move the wall.

15:01.450 --> 15:02.320
- Yes! - Remember.

15:02.690 --> 15:03.861
Be careful, understand?

15:03.920 --> 15:04.721
- Yes. - Yes.

15:04.861 --> 15:05.530
Come on.

15:06.231 --> 15:06.891
Wait.

15:08.361 --> 15:09.060
Chief.

15:09.300 --> 15:10.900
Another team borrowed the hydraulic ram.

15:11.331 --> 15:13.200
Can't you save me anymore?

15:13.601 --> 15:14.670
Don't go.

15:15.641 --> 15:17.001
I'm begging you. Don't go.

15:17.601 --> 15:18.341
Don't go.

15:19.211 --> 15:20.011
Don't be afraid.

15:20.440 --> 15:21.371
We won't leave.

15:40.991 --> 15:41.660
I'll do it.

15:41.991 --> 15:42.660
Come and help.

15:42.930 --> 15:44.461
Break this big wall first.

15:44.530 --> 15:45.400
- Come on. - I'll hold it.

15:45.501 --> 15:46.170
Come on.

15:52.440 --> 15:53.241
Jiang Yi!

15:53.540 --> 15:54.871
Haven't you had enough to eat?

15:55.111 --> 15:56.581
How many people are waiting down there?

15:56.641 --> 15:57.440
Break it!

15:59.410 --> 16:00.111
Yes.

16:14.461 --> 16:15.131
Don't cry.

16:15.560 --> 16:16.530
There's nothing to cry about.

16:17.530 --> 16:18.461
What do you do?

16:20.131 --> 16:21.570
I'm a doctor.

16:22.131 --> 16:23.141
What kind of doctor?

16:24.141 --> 16:25.810
Surgery. General Surgery.

16:27.170 --> 16:27.841
Sir.

16:28.540 --> 16:30.180
I know my hand is useless now.

16:31.410 --> 16:32.280
From now on,

16:32.881 --> 16:35.211
I won't be able to hold a scalpel.

16:37.920 --> 16:39.190
So many people...

16:39.251 --> 16:40.820
can't even make it today.

16:41.751 --> 16:42.690
If you can't do that,

16:42.761 --> 16:43.761
just find another job.

16:45.290 --> 16:46.231
You're still young.

16:46.690 --> 16:47.761
What matters is that you're alive.

16:50.200 --> 16:51.131
You're a man.

16:51.660 --> 16:52.800
No matter how hard you fall,

16:53.800 --> 16:55.371
you must find a way to get back up.

17:18.260 --> 17:18.920
Come on.

17:19.490 --> 17:20.160
Come on.

17:21.690 --> 17:22.361
Come on.

17:23.500 --> 17:24.200
Come on.

17:26.700 --> 17:27.371
Okay.

17:36.480 --> 17:37.341
Lift his butt.

17:37.410 --> 17:38.081
Come on.

17:38.141 --> 17:39.150
Put him on Pi Pi.

17:48.621 --> 17:49.321
Slowly.

17:49.391 --> 17:50.621
Hold him. Slowly.

18:46.111 --> 18:49.581
(Yancheng Emergency Medical Rescue Team)

19:01.730 --> 19:03.230
Did you hurt your hand?

19:03.960 --> 19:04.960
Surgeon.

19:05.061 --> 19:06.271
Is there a surgeon?

19:06.930 --> 19:08.200
There's a serious injury here.

19:17.440 --> 19:18.141
Come with me.

19:18.410 --> 19:19.611
Be careful.

19:24.051 --> 19:25.021
Hang in there.

19:25.081 --> 19:25.891
Endure it a bit.

19:29.220 --> 19:29.920
Don't cry.

19:30.121 --> 19:30.920
Give him anesthesia.

19:30.990 --> 19:31.660
Okay.

19:35.631 --> 19:36.301
Doctor.

19:36.531 --> 19:38.230
Can you save my hand...

19:38.301 --> 19:40.371
and make it as it was before?

19:41.131 --> 19:43.371
I'm a surgeon too.

19:45.170 --> 19:45.910
I'll do my best.

19:46.510 --> 19:47.170
Hang in there.

19:47.240 --> 19:48.111
I'll give you anesthesia.

19:49.240 --> 19:50.410
A lot of people...

19:50.541 --> 19:51.541
lost their lives today.

19:56.521 --> 19:57.450
You're still young.

19:58.680 --> 19:59.720
After today,

20:00.821 --> 20:01.720
live well.

20:02.291 --> 20:03.061
I know.

20:04.660 --> 20:05.321
Just now,

20:06.531 --> 20:08.690
the firefighter who saved me said the same thing.

20:11.930 --> 20:12.970
Am I mistaken?

20:13.500 --> 20:15.000
I can't believe Dr. Xu is comforting him.

20:15.900 --> 20:17.541
Dr. Xu never talked to anyone...

20:17.700 --> 20:19.371
when she was operating before.

20:20.541 --> 20:21.710
We can perform the surgery now.

20:23.281 --> 20:23.980
Get ready for surgery.

20:31.180 --> 20:31.851
Let's go.

20:31.920 --> 20:32.591
Hurry up.

20:32.690 --> 20:33.391
This way. Hurry.

20:37.990 --> 20:38.660
Chief.

20:40.331 --> 20:41.791
We've searched this entire area.

20:41.861 --> 20:42.660
There are no signs of life.

20:42.730 --> 20:44.000
Should we go to the next area?

20:44.861 --> 20:45.801
Everyone has been working continuously...

20:45.871 --> 20:46.771
for over 10 hours.

20:47.470 --> 20:48.531
Let's take a break here.

20:48.601 --> 20:49.301
Okay.

20:49.900 --> 20:50.740
Those from Shilitai.

20:50.900 --> 20:52.101
Rest here for 10 minutes.

20:52.200 --> 20:52.871
- Yes. - Yes.

20:52.940 --> 20:53.611
Okay.

20:53.841 --> 20:54.740
Pi Pi, Da Peng.

20:55.170 --> 20:55.841
Ge Zheng.

20:55.910 --> 20:57.410
- Bring some water for everyone. - Is anyone else here?

20:57.841 --> 20:59.210
Respond if you can hear me.

21:00.611 --> 21:01.781
Is there anyone else?

21:02.781 --> 21:04.220
Respond if you can hear me.

21:05.720 --> 21:06.391
Jiang Yi.

21:06.690 --> 21:07.351
Let's take a break.

21:07.521 --> 21:08.190
Chief.

21:08.420 --> 21:09.091
You guys rest first.

21:09.150 --> 21:09.821
Don't worry about me.

21:11.821 --> 21:12.861
Respond if you can hear me.

21:15.331 --> 21:16.101
Rest.

21:16.160 --> 21:16.930
That's an order.

21:17.500 --> 21:18.160
Chief.

21:18.601 --> 21:19.771
I'm begging you. Leave me alone.

21:20.200 --> 21:21.470
Let me save a few more people.

21:21.700 --> 21:22.541
Is anyone else here?

21:24.301 --> 21:24.970
Rest.

21:28.111 --> 21:29.041
Something's up with you.

21:29.881 --> 21:31.081
I noticed it on the way here.

21:32.650 --> 21:33.410
Something's bothering you.

21:38.081 --> 21:38.750
Tell me.

21:42.420 --> 21:43.091
Chief.

21:44.920 --> 21:46.131
Our house collapsed too.

21:46.861 --> 21:48.331
I couldn't reach my mom.

21:49.960 --> 21:51.131
Isn't your family in Liyang?

21:51.200 --> 21:53.271
My aunt lives in a village at the end of Wangxiang.

21:54.131 --> 21:55.331
She wasn't feeling well.

21:55.531 --> 21:56.601
My mom is here to take care of her.

21:57.041 --> 21:57.970
Since yesterday afternoon,

21:58.041 --> 21:59.410
I haven't been able to reach her.

22:00.710 --> 22:01.410
Which village?

22:01.841 --> 22:02.510
What...

22:02.781 --> 22:03.980
What are your mom and aunt's names?

22:04.281 --> 22:05.480
I'll call the branch now.

22:06.250 --> 22:07.051
Houmiao Village.

22:07.811 --> 22:08.881
My mom's name is Gao Chun Rong.

22:09.081 --> 22:10.220
My aunt's name is Gao Chun Yan.

22:13.091 --> 22:14.051
There's an aftershock!

22:14.121 --> 22:15.051
Put on your helmets!

22:15.121 --> 22:15.920
- Let's go. - An aftershock!

22:17.160 --> 22:18.220
Stay away from the walls.

22:28.930 --> 22:29.700
Monitoring equipment.

22:30.170 --> 22:31.200
Heart rate and blood pressure are all good.

22:31.440 --> 22:32.200
Continue the surgery.

22:32.740 --> 22:33.410
Scissors.

22:37.210 --> 22:38.041
Dr. Xu.

22:38.440 --> 22:39.811
Did you save his hand?

22:40.250 --> 22:42.010
Several tendons and nerves were severed.

22:42.311 --> 22:43.980
It's impossible for him to hold a scalpel anymore.

22:45.051 --> 22:47.321
But if his rehabilitation goes well,

22:47.920 --> 22:49.291
he can regain some of his grip strength.

22:49.660 --> 22:51.361
His hand is badly injured.

22:51.420 --> 22:52.861
He's already very lucky not to get an amputation.

23:01.470 --> 23:02.331
Hold the gauze.

23:05.400 --> 23:06.170
Dr. Xu.

23:07.240 --> 23:07.910
Yes.

23:08.641 --> 23:10.081
There's another victim with an open fracture.

23:10.141 --> 23:11.111
It's very serious.

23:11.180 --> 23:12.081
You should treat him.

23:12.611 --> 23:13.551
Okay, I'm coming.

23:18.480 --> 23:19.150
Let's go.

23:20.621 --> 23:21.391
Dr. Qin, come with me.

23:21.450 --> 23:22.150
Okay.

24:24.180 --> 24:27.351
(Yancheng Emergency Medical Rescue Team)

24:35.690 --> 24:36.930
I'm so tired.

24:40.301 --> 24:41.071
Slow down.

24:47.170 --> 24:49.271
Bei Bei, is there any food?

24:49.611 --> 24:50.781
- What else is there? - Yes.

24:50.841 --> 24:52.541
I'm about to faint from hunger.

24:53.051 --> 24:54.881
It's ready.

24:55.051 --> 24:56.581
Here, eat this first.

24:56.650 --> 24:57.551
It's freshly made.

24:57.621 --> 24:58.950
I want something sweet.

24:59.021 --> 25:00.190
Do you have chocolate?

25:00.521 --> 25:02.021
Egg yolk pie is fine too.

25:02.121 --> 25:03.490
Now is not the time to be picky.

25:03.561 --> 25:05.091
I gave the supplies to the hospital next door.

25:05.160 --> 25:06.260
They came in a hurry.

25:06.331 --> 25:07.160
They didn't bring anything.

25:08.990 --> 25:09.660
Thank you.

25:10.730 --> 25:12.200
All right, just bear with it for now.

25:12.260 --> 25:13.601
More supplies are coming.

25:15.730 --> 25:17.000
Wipe your hands first. Here.

25:17.141 --> 25:17.841
Okay.

25:18.700 --> 25:20.611
This afternoon was quite touching.

25:20.940 --> 25:22.641
Someone secretly came to deliver supplies.

25:22.841 --> 25:23.881
A big pot of boiled eggs.

25:23.940 --> 25:25.180
Yes, they're ready.

25:25.240 --> 25:26.250
I'm soaking them up for you.

25:26.881 --> 25:27.551
Here.

25:27.611 --> 25:28.811
They're still warm.

25:28.980 --> 25:30.150
Thank you.

25:30.220 --> 25:31.121
One for each of you.

25:31.180 --> 25:31.980
- Okay. - Okay.

25:33.450 --> 25:34.190
Aren't you eating?

25:34.250 --> 25:35.321
I already ate.

25:35.490 --> 25:36.361
- Dr. Xu. - All right.

25:36.420 --> 25:37.861
Serve the people then.

25:39.730 --> 25:40.990
At a time like this,

25:41.061 --> 25:42.430
we can still eat eggs.

25:42.490 --> 25:43.230
We can see...

25:43.301 --> 25:45.260
that we're very lucky to be alive.

25:46.771 --> 25:47.571
Yes.

25:47.801 --> 25:49.601
The earthquake lasted for 20 to 30 seconds yesterday.

25:49.970 --> 25:51.740
The whole town was destroyed.

25:52.101 --> 25:53.710
Many people died just like that.

25:54.541 --> 25:56.071
That's how small and fragile...

25:56.440 --> 25:57.180
people are...

25:57.240 --> 25:58.381
in the face of nature.

25:59.180 --> 25:59.980
Now that I think about it,

26:00.051 --> 26:01.381
the trivial things I used to fuss about...

26:01.450 --> 26:02.881
don't seem so important anymore.

26:06.891 --> 26:07.591
I've decided.

26:07.891 --> 26:09.490
I'll reconcile with my boyfriend when I return.

26:09.561 --> 26:11.061
I'll forgive him magnanimously.

26:11.121 --> 26:12.760
If I can be with the one I love,

26:12.831 --> 26:14.490
what's there to complain about?

26:14.631 --> 26:16.160
I don't think you're hungry.

26:16.430 --> 26:17.900
- You're even showing off your love? - Is that so?

26:17.960 --> 26:19.131
I don't think she wants to eat.

26:19.930 --> 26:20.730
It's not easy to have this.

26:20.801 --> 26:22.601
- Yes. - That's right.

26:29.680 --> 26:31.710
Hello, the subscriber you're calling...

26:45.321 --> 26:46.160
Have a bite.

26:46.291 --> 26:47.690
You haven't eaten anything since last night.

26:47.960 --> 26:49.131
How can you have any energy?

26:49.361 --> 26:50.101
Yang Chi.

26:50.660 --> 26:51.430
I'm not hungry.

26:53.601 --> 26:54.400
Trust me.

26:55.531 --> 26:56.700
We saved so many people.

26:56.771 --> 26:57.970
God is watching.

26:58.200 --> 26:59.710
Our moms will definitely be lucky.

26:59.771 --> 27:00.611
They'll be fine.

27:01.141 --> 27:01.841
Eat a bit.

27:09.311 --> 27:10.121
Be strong.

27:21.660 --> 27:22.531
The branch head...

27:22.900 --> 27:24.160
has already contacted the headquarters...

27:24.660 --> 27:25.760
for the search notice.

27:26.930 --> 27:28.331
We'll find out soon.

27:30.301 --> 27:30.970
Thank you, Chief.

27:37.180 --> 27:37.841
Here.

27:38.281 --> 27:39.410
Eat your noodles.

27:42.781 --> 27:43.821
There are a lot of people...

27:44.420 --> 27:45.250
waiting for us to save them.

28:09.910 --> 28:10.581
Here are your noodles.

28:10.680 --> 28:11.341
Okay.

28:11.440 --> 28:12.281
It's freshly made.

28:37.240 --> 28:38.301
Good night, Dr. Xu.

28:54.720 --> 28:55.420
Dr. Xu.

28:55.650 --> 28:57.021
Your feet are so swollen.

29:00.131 --> 29:01.160
I'll get you some medicine.

29:01.230 --> 29:01.960
Spray some on it.

29:02.230 --> 29:03.500
People's Hospital Medical Team.

29:03.601 --> 29:04.760
They need medical support at the scene.

29:04.900 --> 29:06.160
Which one of you can go now?

29:06.601 --> 29:07.801
Dr. Xu, I'm Xu Qin.

29:07.871 --> 29:08.571
I can go.

29:08.700 --> 29:10.141
Okay. I'll arrange a car for you.

29:10.371 --> 29:11.101
It'll be there at once.

29:11.500 --> 29:13.311
Bring medical equipment and a stretcher.

29:13.440 --> 29:14.740
Bring two nurses with you too.

29:14.841 --> 29:15.510
Got it.

29:15.740 --> 29:16.781
Dr. Xu, I'll go with you.

29:16.980 --> 29:17.710
Me too.

29:17.811 --> 29:18.510
Prepare a medical kit.

29:18.581 --> 29:19.240
Okay.

29:21.551 --> 29:22.450
Is your foot okay?

29:24.121 --> 29:24.851
It's fine.

29:24.920 --> 29:25.581
Let's go.

29:33.331 --> 29:34.260
Set up the terminal.

29:55.480 --> 29:56.420
There's a sign of life!

29:56.521 --> 29:57.521
Save him!

29:57.581 --> 29:58.250
Hurry!

29:58.420 --> 29:59.321
Hurry. Go.

30:01.450 --> 30:02.551
Squad One, break the board.

30:02.920 --> 30:03.891
Squad Two, clear the area.

30:18.970 --> 30:19.641
Hurry.

30:19.970 --> 30:20.641
Hurry up.

30:23.210 --> 30:23.881
Comrades.

30:24.240 --> 30:25.811
You have to weigh the pros and cons.

30:26.240 --> 30:27.650
You don't know how deep he's buried.

30:28.010 --> 30:28.980
There's no way to save him.

30:29.311 --> 30:29.980
Let's hurry...

30:30.051 --> 30:31.121
- to go to the next place. - Hurry.

30:31.180 --> 30:32.521
We can save more people.

30:35.821 --> 30:37.291
You spend so many hours...

30:37.561 --> 30:38.521
saving one person.

30:38.920 --> 30:40.631
We don't even know if he's dead or alive.

30:40.861 --> 30:42.791
We might even encounter a second collapse...

30:42.960 --> 30:44.400
and die from it.

30:44.730 --> 30:46.061
Is it worth it?

30:47.470 --> 30:48.271
Those from Shilitai.

30:49.200 --> 30:50.240
Do you remember the oath you took...

30:50.900 --> 30:51.641
on the way here?

30:51.700 --> 30:53.041
- "A solemn promise..." - "A solemn promise..."

30:53.111 --> 30:54.311
- "to every life..." - "to every life..."

30:54.371 --> 30:56.341
- "that we will never give up." - "that we will never give up."

30:58.041 --> 30:58.811
Let's do it then!

30:58.881 --> 30:59.851
- Yes. - Yes.

31:00.210 --> 31:01.010
Hurry.

31:02.351 --> 31:04.220
Captain, let's go to the next place.

31:06.051 --> 31:06.720
Give me the ax.

31:12.561 --> 31:13.230
Take this.

31:17.960 --> 31:18.660
Sir.

31:18.960 --> 31:20.200
Please go to town and get some people.

31:20.271 --> 31:21.400
Call everyone who can help.

31:21.531 --> 31:22.200
Okay.

31:22.271 --> 31:22.930
Thank you.

31:26.740 --> 31:27.510
Slowly.

31:27.910 --> 31:28.710
Be careful.

31:32.811 --> 31:33.680
Slow down!

31:34.710 --> 31:35.381
Song Yan!

31:35.450 --> 31:36.111
Chief.

31:40.051 --> 31:42.021
One, two, three.

31:55.900 --> 31:56.900
Steady, Yang Chi.

32:08.250 --> 32:09.250
Be patient, everyone.

32:09.450 --> 32:10.650
It'll be unblocked soon.

32:10.980 --> 32:11.680
Don't be anxious.

32:17.621 --> 32:18.291
Li Meng.

32:20.230 --> 32:21.361
Why are you here?

32:22.361 --> 32:23.260
I'm settling...

32:24.331 --> 32:25.730
and evacuating people around here.

32:26.061 --> 32:27.230
The station knows you're coming,

32:27.301 --> 32:28.601
so they told me to pick you up.

32:28.831 --> 32:29.500
You...

32:29.571 --> 32:30.740
Did you just walk here?

32:31.500 --> 32:32.301
There was an aftershock.

32:32.400 --> 32:33.371
It was all unblocked before.

32:33.440 --> 32:34.611
Now it's blocked again.

32:34.841 --> 32:35.910
We'll have to walk for a bit.

32:36.141 --> 32:36.811
No problem.

32:36.940 --> 32:37.641
I'll get my bag.

32:40.081 --> 32:40.750
Let me take it.

32:40.811 --> 32:42.581
- I can manage. - I'll take it.

32:42.650 --> 32:43.321
Come on.

32:43.980 --> 32:44.680
Thank you.

32:45.980 --> 32:46.851
- Come on, let's go. - Let's go.

32:48.291 --> 32:49.321
I rushed here after the meeting.

32:49.391 --> 32:50.621
I didn't have time to change.

32:50.690 --> 32:51.420
Slow down.

32:51.660 --> 32:52.720
There are more rocks here.

32:52.861 --> 32:53.660
Okay.

32:54.760 --> 32:55.430
I'm fine.

32:55.490 --> 32:56.160
Slow down.

32:58.260 --> 33:01.000
Did you major in psychology?

33:02.730 --> 33:04.170
During my internship in college,

33:04.240 --> 33:05.571
I was a psychotherapist.

33:05.641 --> 33:07.240
That's why the boss sent me here...

33:07.311 --> 33:09.470
to help you in counseling...

33:09.910 --> 33:11.010
the people in the disaster area.

33:11.680 --> 33:13.781
It's also an essential part...

33:13.851 --> 33:15.051
of disaster recovery.

33:15.611 --> 33:16.281
Also,

33:16.351 --> 33:17.220
the sooner we start, the better.

33:18.021 --> 33:18.920
Have you taken a break...

33:18.980 --> 33:19.720
in the past two days?

33:19.781 --> 33:20.521
Yes.

33:20.891 --> 33:22.420
We took turns resting for half an hour.

33:22.551 --> 33:23.621
We're short-staffed.

33:23.861 --> 33:25.660
We're working hard in the critical 72 hours.

33:25.720 --> 33:26.760
Come in, give me your hand.

33:27.361 --> 33:28.091
Thank you.

33:29.361 --> 33:30.200
Be careful.

33:31.531 --> 33:32.260
You're right.

33:32.760 --> 33:33.601
Right now,

33:33.871 --> 33:34.801
time is of the essence.

33:34.871 --> 33:35.531
Look ahead.

33:36.801 --> 33:37.641
Just a bit further...

33:38.141 --> 33:39.000
and we'll reach the headquarters.

33:40.440 --> 33:41.611
- Okay. - This part isn't an easy route.

33:41.811 --> 33:43.010
Come on, I'll carry you.

33:43.170 --> 33:44.010
No, I can walk.

33:44.081 --> 33:44.781
I'll carry you.

33:44.841 --> 33:45.581
I can really do it.

33:45.641 --> 33:46.781
I can do it too.

33:46.851 --> 33:47.510
I can manage.

33:47.581 --> 33:48.611
Let's go. It's okay.

33:51.480 --> 33:53.081
Jiang Yi's mom and aunt...

33:53.821 --> 33:54.920
couldn't be reached.

33:55.321 --> 33:56.250
This is their information.

34:02.430 --> 34:03.091
Thank you.

34:13.311 --> 34:16.311
Come on, let's go. One, two, three.

34:18.840 --> 34:19.541
Come on.

34:20.610 --> 34:21.280
Are you okay?

34:21.680 --> 34:22.380
I'm fine.

34:22.481 --> 34:23.251
Let's go up and help.

34:26.450 --> 34:27.950
Song Yan, we'll help you.

34:28.021 --> 34:28.691
Don't come up.

34:28.851 --> 34:29.691
Wait down there.

34:30.691 --> 34:31.521
It's dangerous up here.

34:31.691 --> 34:32.360
Go down.

34:32.760 --> 34:33.490
Don't come up. It's dangerous.

34:33.961 --> 34:34.630
Don't worry.

34:36.360 --> 34:37.461
Let's go down.

34:39.101 --> 34:39.760
Come on.

34:40.331 --> 34:41.070
Come on, move it.

34:54.981 --> 34:55.680
Be careful.

35:03.860 --> 35:04.660
Slowly.

35:17.901 --> 35:18.570
Let's go.

35:23.811 --> 35:24.641
I found her!

35:25.410 --> 35:26.280
We found her!

35:26.340 --> 35:27.180
Doctor!

35:27.880 --> 35:28.651
- Let's go. - Okay.

35:29.081 --> 35:29.751
Dr. Xu.

35:29.811 --> 35:30.581
- Let's go up. - Go up.

35:32.921 --> 35:33.590
Chief.

35:33.720 --> 35:34.851
We've done the tests.

35:34.921 --> 35:35.651
It's safe for now.

35:36.090 --> 35:37.220
I suggest we rescue her quickly.

35:39.720 --> 35:40.490
Be careful.

35:45.360 --> 35:46.061
Slowly.

35:46.930 --> 35:47.731
Chief, be careful.

35:50.101 --> 35:51.141
Help me.

35:52.700 --> 35:53.441
Save me.

35:55.311 --> 35:55.970
Come on.

35:59.941 --> 36:00.610
Miss.

36:00.680 --> 36:01.351
How are you doing?

36:01.410 --> 36:02.180
Help me.

36:04.680 --> 36:06.220
One, two, three.

36:13.160 --> 36:14.561
Her legs are fine. Carry her out first.

36:14.660 --> 36:15.331
Jiang Yi.

36:19.101 --> 36:19.760
Slowly.

36:22.001 --> 36:23.470
Miss, hang in there.

36:29.671 --> 36:31.180
Chief, be careful.

36:36.680 --> 36:37.380
It's okay.

36:37.880 --> 36:38.621
We're coming out.

36:38.680 --> 36:39.351
Come on.

36:39.651 --> 36:40.391
Jun Ping, Pi Pi.

36:40.590 --> 36:41.251
Don't cry.

36:41.320 --> 36:42.121
- Pi Pi. - It's okay. Come on.

36:42.191 --> 36:42.851
- Come on. - Come on.

36:42.921 --> 36:43.990
- Hold her. - Come on.

36:44.260 --> 36:44.961
Slowly.

36:45.760 --> 36:46.461
All right.

36:46.860 --> 36:47.691
Let go.

36:47.891 --> 36:48.930
We have the best physician...

36:49.130 --> 36:50.260
to bandage you.

36:52.101 --> 36:53.200
All right.

36:53.260 --> 36:54.130
- Don't cry. - Come on.

36:54.200 --> 36:54.970
Be careful.

36:55.700 --> 36:56.401
Slowly.

36:56.630 --> 36:57.541
Pi Pi, over there.

36:57.601 --> 36:58.371
Don't move.

37:13.320 --> 37:14.021
I'll do it.

37:25.001 --> 37:25.700
She's already gone.

37:26.160 --> 37:27.101
Let's save the others.

37:36.010 --> 37:36.671
Wait.

37:46.720 --> 37:47.651
She's pregnant.

38:00.200 --> 38:01.101
Turn her over.

38:06.601 --> 38:08.371
Usually, 5 to 8 minutes after the mother dies,

38:08.711 --> 38:09.811
the baby dies too.

38:16.751 --> 38:17.481
There's a heartbeat.

38:17.880 --> 38:18.651
The baby is alive.

38:19.081 --> 38:20.521
Can we save him if we take her to the hospital now?

38:20.990 --> 38:22.421
It's too late. I have to do a C-section now.

38:23.450 --> 38:24.220
Are you confident?

38:25.760 --> 38:26.461
No.

38:26.891 --> 38:27.561
I'll try.

38:28.961 --> 38:29.760
Lay her down flat.

38:35.501 --> 38:36.271
Be careful.

39:17.010 --> 39:17.740
Come on.

39:30.291 --> 39:30.961
Dr. Xu.

39:36.130 --> 39:36.831
Thank you.

39:48.711 --> 39:49.441
Scissors.

40:05.061 --> 40:05.860
Prepare the scalpel.

40:16.271 --> 40:17.041
Compress.

40:54.211 --> 40:55.541
- The baby's out! - The baby's born!

41:16.260 --> 41:17.061
Be careful.

42:32.340 --> 42:33.101
Slowly.
